+/// 0.8.20 Slice 20c — steps (2) and (3) of the declared-backfill above, as their
+/// own function because **both** enrolment doors owe this treatment.
+///
+/// fix-2 (codex §9 [P2]): [`enqueue_declared_vector_backfill`] is the DECLARE-time
