///
/// `dense_arm_live` is `ProjectionRuntimeShared::embedder.is_some()`, read once
/// per dispatcher because it is fixed for the session's lifetime.
///
/// # fix-5 (codex §9 round 4 [P1]) — why the node exclusion is IN the SQL
